🚀 Day 1 Assignment: HTML Detective!

Hey Web Detectives! 🕵️‍♀️

Your mission: peek behind the scenes of any website and discover its skeleton!

Steps:

Open any website and view its page source (Ctrl + U).

Spot the main sections: <html>, <head>, <body>.

Find one heading, one paragraph, and one link. Note their tags.

Bonus: Draw a tiny “HTML skeleton” showing <html>, <head>, and <body> like a treasure map! 🗺️

💡 Fun Tip: Every website has a hidden structure – today, you’re the detective uncovering it! 🔍
